  {
   "text": "In 1989, one press-conference answer opened the Berlin Wall.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.26
  },
  {
   "text": "To see how, start with a note.",
   "start": 4.26,
   "end": 6.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Spokesman G\u00fcnter Schabowski has just been handed it.",
   "start": 7.14,
   "end": 9.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Asked when it starts, he says: immediately, without delay.",
   "start": 10.2,
   "end": 13.58
  },
  {
   "text": "West German news tells viewers the borders are open.",
   "start": 14.46,
   "end": 16.86
  },
  {
   "text": "That night, guards at Bornholmer Stra\u00dfe let people through.",
   "start": 17.62,
   "end": 20.6
  },
  {
   "text": "A wall that stood for decades opened on one unprepared answer.",
   "start": 21.5,
   "end": 25.28
  }
 ]
